filex-office-editor (scripts/x2t), BRF Tech, 2026-10-10: x2t links ONLYOFFICE's
StarMath converter (OdfFile/Reader/Converter/StarMath2OOXML, built by
steps.sh), which CryptPad's build leaves out.

Measured (2026-10-10): without it, an odt, ods or odp with a formula as
LibreOffice writes one (MathML with its StarMath annotation) stops the
module - "Aborted(missing function: _ZN8StarMath18CStarMathConverterC1Ev)"
- in CryptPad's v9.3.2+3 as in this build before the change: the ODF reader
converts the annotation to OOXML math with that converter
(OdfFile/Reader/Format/math_elements.cpp). With it the formula comes into
the document.

git apply reads from the first "diff --git" line on.

diff --git a/X2tConverter/build/Qt/X2tConverter.pri b/X2tConverter/build/Qt/X2tConverter.pri
